Subject: [PATCH] api/ongoing-group-join: join group calls already going on

The lobby query (<lobby query="1"/> to <id>@call) and the join <accept>
(Opus 16 kHz, net, encopt, capability; no preaccept), as WhatsApp Web sends
them. Validated: signaling/ongoing_group_test.go against the capture in
datasheets/voip-ongoing-group-join.md, engine_ongoing_group_test.go for the
lobby roster and the join sequence. Not yet run against a live call.

Source of truth: datasheets/voip-ongoing-group-join.md
